<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Barplats lifts yr attrib income.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Barplats lifts yr attrib income.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.18 vs 0.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.44 vs 0.20</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.26 vs 0.16</p>
<p>    Investment income     0.75 vs 0.45</p>
<p>Full name: Barplats Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the main features of the year were:</p>
<p>- the prospects of the Crocodile River Mine and Kennedy's Vale Mine were continually evaluated but at current prices still not considered viable;</p>
<p>- cash resources increased from 3.8 million rand to 6.9 million rand; and</p>
<p>- the sale of Barplats Refineries (Pty) Ltd for U.S.$2.25 million.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
